# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
# package-lock.json is intentionally NOT committed — Tailwind v4's native
# bindings (@tailwindcss/oxide-*) are platform-specific, and a lock file
# generated on Linux pins the linux-x64 variant and breaks `npm install`
# for macOS / Windows contributors with EBADPLATFORM. Letting npm regenerate
# the lock file per-platform avoids the error at the cost of strict
# transitive-version reproducibility (acceptable for a side project).
package-lock.json

